s and is not bound to accept the lowest nor any quote. The Department has discretion to manage this procurement as it sees fit. If the Department accepts your offer, it will be subject to the attached Services Contract\nIf you have any questions, please contact tenders@dpird.nsw.gov.au.\nYours sincerely,\nPamela Van Der Merwe\nTeam Leader Business Performance\nRespondents must complete the below Response form ? Due \nResponse\nMilestone Pricing\nThe successful supplier(s) will be required to provide insurance details and a certificate of insurance at the time of contract award for the following insurances.\nInsurance Type\nPublic Liability - $10 million\nProfessional Indemnity - $5 million\nWorkers Compensation - As required by law\nPersonal Accident and Sickness insurance (if supplier is a sole trader or a partnership)\nSigned by the Supplier?s authorised representative who warrants authority to submit this Quote on behalf of the Supplier and is not aware of any conflict of interest:\n'}], 'content_hash': None, 'tags': None, 'first_seen_at': None, 'last_scanned_at': '2026-09-30T21:12:18.235413+00:00', 'updated_at': None, 'raw_extra': '{"tags": ["professional services", "consulting"]}', 'focus_areas': None, 'work_types': None, 'fit': 0, 'fit_reason': "The opportunity is for research, writing, and content development for a commemorative publication, which does not align with SVA's focus on social outcomes. The work type of producing a historical manuscript is not covered by the provided taxonomy.", 'embedding': [0.06061439588665962, 0.023394949734210968, 0.01853766478598118, 0.020536724478006363, -0.007275796961039305, 0.0726785734295845, 0.004392281174659729, 0.056196458637714386, 0.016634181141853333, -0.01125677302479744, -0.002002979861572385, -0.0021274304017424583, 0.056087926030159, 0.021192923188209534, -0.026940440759062767, 0.022118832916021347, 0.008847742341458797, 0.03163028135895729, -0.08862907439470291, -0.013940408825874329, -0.029670681804418564, -0